# An exercise's last time before a date. Start the API with Aspire first.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@accessToken = paste-an-access-token
@exerciseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Its last time, or null → 200. An unknown exercise → 404.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/last-time?before=2026-11-10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
